model {
  extend basalt.build {
    metadata {
      constraint "External test-service setup and cleanup make at most four attempts within one 30-second budget and log each retry. Emulator setup also abandons and repeats a request that hangs for 6 seconds, because its instance, keyed-credential and reset calls converge when repeated; billing catalog seeding never retries a timeout. Scenario requests stay single-attempt, and exhausted failures keep their real cause, attempt count and redacted diagnostics."
    }
  }
}
